{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13492","headline":"奉和圣制早登太行山中言志 · 苗晋卿","name":"奉和圣制早登太行山中言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金吾戒道清，羽骑动天声。\n砥路方南绝，重岩始北征。\n关楼前望远，河邑下观平。\n喜气回舆合，祥风入斾轻。\n祝尧三老至，会禹百神迎。\n月令农先急，春蒐礼复行。\n仍亲后土祭，更理晋阳兵。\n不似劳车辙，空留八骏名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苗晋卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}